From 565c2bda9e6dd2c41fa0dcc598bdbc52f2d64885 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Upamanyu Sharma <upamanyu-claude4@csail.mit.edu>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 06:17:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] raft: switch to a snapshot's configuration when it is applied

Conf changes applied after a snapshot was restored, from a Ready handed out
before it, applied on top of the snapshot's configuration, though the
snapshot already included them (a wrong configuration, or a panic in
applyConfChange). The configuration now switches in appliedSnap.
The fix of etcd-grove's issues/raft-snapshot-during-apply-stale-confchange.md
(upstream candidate fix/raft-snapshot-during-apply-stale-confchange), on v3.7.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
